==Battleground==
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*4 [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Demon Doge]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

